							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "**FAMIX** is the set of building blocks for describing code: namespaces, classes, methods, attributes, inheritance, calls, methods, attributes, calls. It's the vocabulery; Moose is the engine that uses it."
