							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Extension methods is special: A protocol starting with `*` puts the method into a different package from its class. For example, a method in  protocol `*Gt4Kotlin` on `MooseAbstractGroup` belongs to the `Gt4Kotlin` package even though the class lives in `Moose-Core`."
